{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21728","headline":"酬乐天吟张员外诗见寄因思上京每与乐天於居敬兄升平里咏张新诗 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天吟张员外诗见寄因思上京每与乐天於居敬兄升平里咏张新诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐天书内重封到，居敬堂前共读时。\n四友一爲泉路客，三人两咏浙江诗。\n别无远近皆难见，老减心情自各知。\n杯酒与他年少隔，不相酬赠欲何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}